OL,3,GNEWSAInjured peregrine falcon rescued
OL,4,Afrom cliff rocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn injured peregrine falcon has been
OL,7,Frescued after it was found stranded on
OL,8,Frocks.
OL,10,FBrixham fisherman Tristan Northway
OL,11,Fdiscovered the falcon, waterlogged and
OL,12,Fwith visible injuries, near Berry
OL,13,FHead's cliffs and took it to a marine
OL,14,Fwildlife team at the Cove Discovery
OL,15,FProject in Brixham in Devon.
OL,17,FDuncan Kenny from the project said he
OL,18,Fthought the year-old bird had moved
OL,19,Finto the territory of a dominant female
OL,20,Fwhich may have attacked it.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
