OL,3,GNEWSAInjured peregrine falcon rescued
OL,4,Afrom cliff rocks
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It is rare to rescue a peregrine and
OL,7,Fit was a privilege as you rarely handle
OL,8,Fthem," Kenny, who is a licenced
OL,9,Fperegrine ringer, said.
